  * Fix: Settings search highlight now handles query extension.
    Beta53's comment claimed React would reconcile the previous
    run's <mark> wraps away — untrue, React's diff only touches
    nodes whose JSX changed and the imperative wraps are invisible
    to it.  Result: typing "bar" left an old <mark>ba</mark> in
